---
// Hero section: wordmark, lede, CTA row, and the map-card visual.
---

<section class="hero">
  <div class="wrap hero-grid">
    <div>
      <span class="pill"><span class="dot"></span>Claude Code + Codex plugin</span>
      <h1 class="wordmark"><span class="t">trail</span><span class="h">head</span></h1>
      <p class="lede">Start and drive large projects as a <b>map of tickets on GitHub Issues</b>, resolving one at a time until the way to the destination is clear.</p>
      <div class="teams">
        <svg width="18" height="18" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"><path d="M17 21v-2a4 4 0 0 0-4-4H5a4 4 0 0 0-4 4v2"/><circle cx="9" cy="7" r="4"/><path d="M23 21v-2a4 4 0 0 0-3-3.87"/><path d="M16 3.13a4 4 0 0 1 0 7.75"/></svg>
        <span><b>Built for teams:</b> many hands on one map, a ticket each, no collisions.</span>
      </div>
      <div class="cta-row">
        <span class="install-inline"><span class="prompt">$</span> npx @marcomigozzi/trailhead <button class="copy" type="button" data-copy-text="npx @marcomigozzi/trailhead">copy</button></span>
        <a class="btn-ghost" href="#install">or as a Claude Code plugin <span class="arrow">&rarr;</span></a>
      </div>
      <div class="metaline">
        <a href="https://github.com/ToRvaLDz/trailhead">github.com/ToRvaLDz/trailhead</a>
        <span>·</span>
        <span>MIT licensed</span>
        <span>·</span>
        <span>Claude Code &amp; Codex CLI</span>
      </div>
    </div>

    <!-- map card visual -->
    <div class="mapcard" aria-hidden="true">
      <div class="mapcard-head">
        <div class="mapcard-title"><span class="diamond">&#9670;</span> checkout map</div>
        <div class="mapcard-count"><b>11</b>/18 resolved</div>
      </div>
      <div class="bar"><span></span></div>
      <div class="row active">
        <span class="tag build">build</span>
        <span class="title">Checkout page UI</span>
        <span class="tag frontier">frontier</span>
        <span class="avatar av-mm">MM</span>
      </div>
      <div class="row">
        <span class="tag bug">bug</span>
        <span class="title">Rate-limit retry</span>
        <span class="avatar av-al">AL</span>
      </div>
      <div class="row done">
        <span class="tag decision">decision</span>
        <span class="title">Payment provider</span>
        <span class="check">&#10003;</span>
      </div>
      <div class="mapcard-foot">
        <div class="stack"><span class="avatar av-mm">MM</span><span class="avatar av-al">AL</span><span class="avatar av-rs">RS</span></div>
        <span>3 teammates on the map</span>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>
